---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Profile" description="Vaibhav's Homepage on the internet">
    <style>
        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .tooltip {
            visibility: hidden;
            position: absolute;
        }
        .has-tooltip:hover .tooltip {
            visibility: visible;
            z-index: 100;
        }
    </style>
    <main id="main" class="space-y-12 pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-8 relative">
        <h1 class="sr-only">Vaibhav Kubre — Profile</h1>
        <div class="col-span-2 bg-white relative">
            <div
                class="px-3 md:px-4 justify-around absolute space-y-[7.38rem] md:space-y-[9.12rem] -top-3 bottom-0 z-10"
            >
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full md:block"></div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="mx-12 md:mx-14 px-4 py-12 border-x border-enamel text-carbon leading-6 md:leading-6 text-xs md:text-sm"
            >
                ## Profile: Senior Software Engineer<br /><br class="" />
                ## Skills (in his own words): <br />
                "<span class="">Obsession</span> and <span class="">reliability</span> are the only two
                skills I have."<br /><br />

                ## Further comments:<br />
                "Love for computers is beyond everything."<br /><br />

                ## Interests:
                <figure>
                    <img
                        class="mt-4 invert grayscale contrast-200 border"
                        alt="Event Horizon"
                        src="/images/black-hole.jpg"
                        width="1200"
                        height="675"
                        decoding="async"
                        title="I hope to travel far enough one day to reach the unknown."
                    />
                    <figcaption class="text-center">Fig 1: Event Horizon</figcaption>
                </figure>
            </div>
            <div
                class="px-3 md:px-4 justify-around absolute space-y-[7.38rem] md:space-y-[9.12rem] -top-3 bottom-0 right-0 z-10"
            >
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full"></div>
                <div class="h-6 w-6 bg-enamel rounded-full md:block"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <section class="sr-only">
            <h2>About this site</h2>
            <p>
                Vaibhav Kubre is a senior software engineer who builds reliable systems and
                keyboard-first tools. He works across TypeScript, Swift, and the web platform, and
                he cares most about software that behaves the same way on a bad day as it does on a
                good one.
            </p>
            <p>
                This site is his public archive. <a href="/work">Work</a> holds project write-ups with
                real engineering detail, <a href="/blog">Blog</a> holds technical writing, and
                <a href="/travel">Travel</a> holds notes from places he has been. The
                <a href="/about">About</a> page describes the stack behind the site.
            </p>
        </section>
        <div class="min-h-20"></div>
        <div class="flex">
            <a class="text-base ml-auto px-2 bg-yellow-200 underline" href="/resume"
                >Complete Resume →</a
            >
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
